@startuml
!include ../includes/attestify-theme.puml
!include ../includes/sequence-conventions.puml
title Diagnostic Translation And Receipt Projection
participant "Capability driver" as Driver
participant "Use Case" as UC
participant "Command adapter" as Adapter
participant stdout
Driver --> UC: Completed or Rejected(diagnostic)
UC --> Adapter: preserve diagnostic fields
alt package or Verify dispatched outcome
  Adapter -> stdout: one Receipt V2 + LF
else Start or Evidence
  Adapter -> stdout: silent success
end
note over Driver,Adapter: Unexpected seam defects remain Kernel errors.
@enduml
